{"id":"5252b28de1f68970","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-mgu.md","title":"df-mgu","display":"df-mgu","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","depends_on":["[[56-df-substitution]]","[[56-df-substitution-application]]","[[56-df-substitution-composition]]"],"label":"56-df-mgu","aliases":["56-df-mgu"],"display":"df-mgu","type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6228082765353868\" href=\"?note=6228082765353868\" title=\"56-df-substitution\">56-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0df0123405bbc66d\" href=\"?note=0df0123405bbc66d\" title=\"56-df-substitution-composition\">56-df-substitution-composition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-mgu"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-mgu</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mgu"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in T\">\\(s,t\\in T\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>替换集、项应用及后缀组合分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6228082765353868\" href=\"?note=6228082765353868\" title=\"56-df-substitution\">56-df-substitution</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0df0123405bbc66d\" href=\"?note=0df0123405bbc66d\" title=\"56-df-substitution-composition\">56-df-substitution-composition</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Unif}(s,t)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\mid s\\sigma=t\\sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Unif}(s,t)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\mid s\\sigma=t\\sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MGU}(s,t)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Unif}(s,t)\\mid\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Unif}(s,t)\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\;(\\tau=\\sigma\\circ\\rho)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MGU}(s,t)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Unif}(s,t)\\mid\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Unif}(s,t)\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\;(\\tau=\\sigma\\circ\\rho)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{mgu}(s,t,\\sigma)\\iff\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{MGU}(s,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{mgu}(s,t,\\sigma)\\iff\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{MGU}(s,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Unifiable}(s,t)\\iff\\operatorname{Unif}(s,t)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Unifiable}(s,t)\\iff\\operatorname{Unif}(s,t)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>MGU(s,t) 为最一般合一替换的集合，不是未经选择的单值函数；对不可合一输入该集合为空。下游应写 σ∈MGU(s,t)，不写 σ=mgu(s,t)。本定义不把存在性定理混作定义；原书另讨论合一算法。</p>\n<p>有限目标的MGU接口与完整的语法合一过程分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8198395909603c44\" href=\"?note=8198395909603c44\" title=\"56-df-unification-problem\">56-df-unification-problem</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3c8230787b91c51f\" href=\"?note=3c8230787b91c51f\" title=\"56-thm-mm-unification-correctness\">56-thm-mm-unification-correctness</a>。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>，§2.1.4定义2.1.19之后的合一讨论及§7.7定理7.7.6，印刷第33、293–294页，OCR页块54、314–315。定义2.1.19本身定义的是替换实例预序，不把它误标为独立的MGU定义编号。本次据用户提供的本地 DjVu 文字层核对陈述；OCR页块序号不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"6228082765353868","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-composition","status":"resolved","id":"0df0123405bbc66d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-composition]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"6228082765353868","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"替换集、项应用及后缀组合分别见 [[56-df-substitution]]、[[56-df-substitution-application]]、[[56-df-substitution-composition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"替换集、项应用及后缀组合分别见 [[56-df-substitution]]、[[56-df-substitution-application]]、[[56-df-substitution-composition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-composition","status":"resolved","id":"0df0123405bbc66d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"替换集、项应用及后缀组合分别见 [[56-df-substitution]]、[[56-df-substitution-application]]、[[56-df-substitution-composition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-unification-problem","status":"resolved","id":"8198395909603c44","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"有限目标的MGU接口与完整的语法合一过程分别见 [[56-df-unification-problem]]、[[56-thm-mm-unification-correctness]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-mm-unification-correctness","status":"resolved","id":"3c8230787b91c51f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"有限目标的MGU接口与完整的语法合一过程分别见 [[56-df-unification-problem]]、[[56-thm-mm-unification-correctness]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Unif}(s,t)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\mid s\\sigma=t\\sigma\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MGU}(s,t)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Unif}(s,t)\\mid\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Unif}(s,t)\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\;(\\tau=\\sigma\\circ\\rho)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{mgu}(s,t,\\sigma)\\iff\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{MGU}(s,t).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Unifiable}(s,t)\\iff\\operatorname{Unif}(s,t)\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true}],"bytes":1825,"backlinks":[{"id":"4176ebfcf797c869","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ApartVariants}$ 见 [[56-df-overlap]]，$\\mathrm{MGU}$ 见 [[56-df-mgu]]，替换子项见 [[56-df-replace]]。"},{"id":"8d38c305aa30cc4d","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"位置和子项见 [[56-df-position]]、[[56-df-subterm]]，最一般合一子集合 $\\mathrm{MGU}(s,t)$ 见 [[56-df-mgu]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-380","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-mgu]]"},{"id":"3c8230787b91c51f","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，$S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\boldsymbol E=(E_0,\\ldots,E_n)\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot^{n+1}$，$\\boldsymbol\\delta\\in S^n$。假设 $\\operatorname{Maximal}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)$，并令 $a=\\operatorname{Answer}(\\boldsymbol\\delta)$。运行、目标解集和幂等性见 [[56-thm-mm-run-invariant]] 及其运行接口，终止及末端分类见 [[56-thm-mm-unification-termination]]，二项MGU接口见 [[56-df-mgu]]。"}],"outgoing":["6228082765353868","6aa7f56f36c897f4","0df0123405bbc66d","8198395909603c44","3c8230787b91c51f"]}